+-- The sheet's review SLA: a REVIEW claim whose review day (the sheet's today when it went to REVIEW) plus
+-- this many days is before the sheet's today is late for review. None means none. Not dated.
+ALTER TABLE sheet ADD COLUMN review_sla INTEGER CHECK (review_sla >= 0);
